entered into a securities purchase agreement with an accredited investor, whereby investor purchased from the Company &lt;span id="xdx_908_ecustom--SeriesCPreferredSharesIssuedShares_c20220906__20220906__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--SeriesCPreferredStockMember_znpsgJTo26ug"&gt;90,275&lt;/span&gt; shares of
