of Series C Convertible Preferred Stock of the Company for a purchase price of &lt;span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromIssuanceOrSaleOfEquity_c20211021__20211021__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--PreferredClassCMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__custom--AccreditedInvestorTwoMember_zEp4O9RcSObe"&gt;$85,450&lt;/span&gt;. The closing occurred on October 21,
